---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Crystal Cleansing & Care Guide | Serenity Crystals">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm">Sacred Rituals</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mt-2 mb-4 tracking-tight">Crystal Cleansing & Care Guide</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Crystals absorb and transmit energetic vibrations from their surroundings. To keep your sacred stones working at their highest potential, regular cleansing and recharging are essential.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12">
      <!-- Moonlight Charging -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-xl flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532693322450-2cb5c511067d?w=600" alt="Moonlight Charging" class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-56 w-full shadow-md border border-slate-700/50" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-2/3">
          <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-950 text-indigo-300 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold mb-3">Recharging Practice</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Full Moonlight Bathing</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The gentle, receptive energy of the moon is the safest and most effective way to recharge all crystal types without risk of fading or damage. 
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full mr-3"></span>Place crystals on a windowsill or outdoor surface during the night of the Full Moon.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full mr-3"></span>Set an intentional affirmation to clear stagnant energy.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full mr-3"></span>Retrieve them the following morning energized and renewed.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Selenite Cleansing -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-xl flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567225557594-88d73e55f2cb?w=600" alt="Selenite Cleansing" class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-56 w-full shadow-md border border-slate-700/50" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-2/3">
          <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-purple-950 text-purple-300 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold mb-3">Purification Ritual</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Selenite Charging Plates</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Selenite is a high-vibration master cleansing crystal that never needs cleansing itself. It actively neutralizes lower frequencies in neighboring stones.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-400 rounded-full mr-3"></span>Place your jewelry and tumbled stones directly on a Selenite slab or charging bowl.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-400 rounded-full mr-3"></span>Leave overnight for complete energetic reset.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-400 rounded-full mr-3"></span>Note: Keep Selenite away from water as it is water-soluble.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Smudging -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-xl flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599566150163-29194dcaad36?w=600" alt="Smudging & Smoke" class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-56 w-full shadow-md border border-slate-700/50" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-2/3">
          <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-300 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold mb-3">Smoke Cleansing</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Sacred Smoke & Sound</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Passing crystals through the sacred smoke of white sage, palo santo, or bathing them in singing bowl resonance instantly breaks up dense energetic attachments.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full mr-3"></span>Pass each crystal through the rising smoke for 30 seconds.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full mr-3"></span>Use singing bowl tones to vibrate and shake loose lingering heavy energies.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full mr-3"></span>Always ensure proper ventilation during indoor smoke cleansing.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
